OL,3,GNEWSA'Better results for patients'
OL,4,Asince SWAH surgery suspended, says
OL,5,Ahealth chief
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is a question mark over whether
OL,8,Frestoring emergency general surgery at
OL,9,Fthe South West Acute Hospital (SWAH) in
OL,10,FEnniskillen "is the right thing to do",
OL,11,Faccording to the chief executive of the
OL,12,FWestern Health Trust.
OL,14,FKaren Hargan told Stormont's Health
OL,15,FCommittee that there had been "better
OL,16,Foutcomes for patients" since the
OL,17,Fservice was withdrawn - and that
OL,18,Freinstating it would come at a
OL,19,Fsubstantial financial cost.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
