OL,3,GNEWSA'Better results for patients'
OL,4,Asince SWAH surgery suspended, says
OL,5,Ahealth chief
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmergency general surgery was
OL,8,Ftemporarily suspended at SWAH in
OL,9,FDecember 2022 as difficulties in
OL,10,Frecruiting surgical staff meant there
OL,11,Fwas a risk to patient safety.
OL,13,FPatients in need of emergency general
OL,14,Fsurgery are now taken by ambulance to
OL,15,FAltnagelvin Hospital in Londonderry.
